	'k8951eaef' => 'Admissions consultations are managed by Samuel Brandt between 12:00 and 17:00 on weekdays, before evening classes commence. During these hours, prospective students can visit 14 Linden Quay to review course materials, inspect past mock papers, and discuss programme timetables in a quiet environment. If you work standard business hours and cannot visit during the early afternoon, Samuel is also available by appointment on Saturday mornings between 09:00 and 13:00. We recommend contacting us at least one day in advance so we can reserve dedicated time to review your study plans without interruption.',
