	'k9733e7d0' => 'Tochi Academy offers no shortcuts, effortless study routes, or unearned examination results. The real-estate licence examination is rigorous, demanding independent discipline, extensive statutory reading, and continuous application across the 24-week curriculum. What we provide is an orderly environment, meticulous teaching, marked mock papers, and seasoned feedback from practicing professionals. Our classrooms at 14 Linden Quay are purpose-built for adult learners, offering quiet seminar rooms, extensive reference texts, and open study desks overlooking the water. We expect every candidate to attend all scheduled sessions, complete assigned weekly readings, and engage candidly with mock assessments. Success on sitting day comes from cumulative comprehension and patient study, not commercial claims.',
