	'kd7ee4c50' => 'Agents’ juniors · Starts 28.09.2026',
	'kd8d82be4' => 'Tochi Academy collects personal information necessary to deliver our educational services and administer course enrolments at 14 Linden Quay. This information includes your name, postal address, telephone number, email address, chosen programme of study, and records of attendance. For enrolled students, we also maintain academic records, including written homework submissions, tutor feedback notes, and mock examination scores generated during the 24-week term. When you visit our website or submit an inquiry through our contact forms, we record only the contact details you voluntarily provide to communicate regarding open evenings, course timetables, or admissions.',
	'kd8ef7c83' => 'Visit our classrooms at 14 Linden Quay, observe our teaching methods, and discuss your study plans with faculty members.',
	'kd90e2f6f' => 'Read candid reflections from working professionals who balanced daily employment with evening studies at Tochi Academy.',
	'kd9f6f133' => 'Tuition fees include complete physical course binders, annotated statutory excerpts, weekly lecture notes, and practice question sets. Students also receive direct access to our evening reference library at 14 Linden Quay until 21:45 on class nights, where key legal volumes and planning registers are maintained. All written assignments submitted during the term receive individual written critique from the module instructor. In addition, candidates enrolled in the Evening Licence Course or Weekend Intensive receive full access to our mock assessment days and instructor feedback sessions without additional charge.',
