	'kdb2b4103' => 'Four timed mock papers with individual marked feedback, then targeted revision before the sitting.',
	'kdb712156' => 'What we expect and what we never promise',
	'kdc120b89' => 'Omar Haddad',
	'kddb7b544' => 'Who is each cohort designed for?',
	'kdf199981' => '6 evenings. Targeted instruction in one subject such as contracts, valuation or property law.',
	'kdfaba8cd' => 'From another career into real estate',
	'kdfec7162' => 'See the college before you commit: the next <a href="/open-evening/">open evenings</a> are fortnightly on Thursdays at 19:00.',
	'ke09676ae' => '8 weeks',
	'ke09f4cba' => 'The Tochi Academy newsletter is a concise informational bulletin dispatched exactly once per month. It contains critical administrative dates for upcoming cohorts, notices for open evenings at 14 Linden Quay, reminders for statutory exam registration deadlines, and brief commentary on property regulation from our faculty. We do not distribute advertising, third-party promotional material, or frequent marketing broadcasts. The newsletter is intended solely to help prospective applicants and current students track important milestones in the academic calendar, ensuring they never miss enrolment deadlines or examination sitting dates.',
	'ke25eef1f' => 'Ines Marlow, a former conveyancer, leads the foundations module and the college. Tomas Reyes teaches contracts and leases from his background in commercial lease drafting. Priya Natarajan covers property law and disclosure, Daniel Okafor valuation and floor plans, and Hana Liu tax and transaction finance.',
	'ke281aeae' => 'Tuition covers all course materials, syllabus binders and exam workshop access. The course fees can be paid in three equal instalments.',
