	'ke9d45c58' => 'Admissions &amp; student office',
	'keba2aa16' => 'Who is each cohort for? ↓',
	'kebb3704d' => 'Tochi Academy delivers two main cohorts annually. The Autumn cohort begins Week 1 on Monday 28 September 2026 and concludes with the official examination sitting on Sunday 14 March 2027. The formal enrolment deadline for the Autumn intake is 7 September 2026. The Spring cohort commences on Monday 26 April 2027 and works toward the examination sitting on Sunday 17 October 2027, with registrations closing on 5 April 2027. Each cohort runs for exactly 24 weeks. Seats are capped at 18 students per group to preserve classroom dialogue and detailed marking turnaround. Prospective students must submit admissions forms prior to the posted closing dates.',
