	'kf3c34053' => 'Meet them: <a href="/open-evening/">book an open evening</a>.',
	'kf402207e' => 'For professionals from corporate, hospitality or administrative backgrounds. You build the legal, financial and regulatory foundations from the ground up through guided evening seminars.',
	'kf47b919b' => 'Leah joined the Autumn 2024 cohort while working full-time in hotel operations. Facing demanding shift rotations, she needed a predictable, disciplined environment to master commercial property law.',
